      <trans-unit id="taskcenter-admin" resname="taskcenter-admin" approved="yes">
        <source>It is simple to extend the taskcenter by a custom task. For more information please look into the manual of the extension 'taskcenter'.</source>
        <target state="final">ມັນງ່າຍທີ່ຈະຂະຫຍາຍ taskcenter ດ້ວຍໜ້າວຽກທີ່ກຳນົດເອງ. ສຳລັບຂໍ້ມູນເພີ່ມເຕີມ ກະລຸນາເບິ່ງໃນຄູ່ມືຂອງສ່ວນຂະຫຍາຍ 'taskcenter'.</target>
      </trans-unit>
